# Standalone Image Conversion Tool

This plan outlines the architecture and implementation for an image converter desktop tool that converts WebP and AVIF formats into PNG and allows the addition of Geotag coordinates.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> To fulfill the requirement of a completely standalone app, this will be built as a Python desktop application with a modern GUI rather than a web application. 

## Proposed Architecture

This system will utilize a modern UI Python framework designed for premium local tools.

### Standalone Python App (CustomTkinter)
- **UI Framework (`customtkinter`)**: Ensures a premium, modern, dark-mode native interface that avoids standard legacy Tkinter aesthetics.
- **Image Processing (`Pillow` and `pillow-avif-plugin`)**: Easily handles fast local conversion of `.webp` and `.avif` standard formats seamlessly.
- **Metadata Management (`Pillow` EXIF tags / `piexif`)**: Injects exact EXIF chunks into the standard PNG layout, calculating proper GPS rational formats from simple floating-point coordinates.

